      "heading": "1 · Generate, then select",
      "sentence": "Creativity needs both exploration and systematic evaluation — schedule both, never in the same minute.",
      "quote": "In order to be able to use the provocative qualities of lateral thinking one must also be able to follow up with the selective qualities of vertical thinking.",
